users/productionhome2022-hash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Inventory PRs #30, #31, #33, #35, #38, #39 and #40 and compute changed-path intersections.\n- Record the dependency chain #35 -> #38 and the shared economic/governance/backend paths requiring one combined semantic review.\n- Add the mandatory deep-review gate for every duplicate/similar file: full exact-SHA content comparison, reference/dependency tracing, test comparison, provenance review and canonical-path decision before any move or deletion.\n- Inspect workflow YAML and document branch-trigger coverage gaps: current workflows use push + workflow_dispatch, not pull_request; #30/#31/#39/#40 are absent from the inspected branch filters.\n- Distinguish empty PR-triggered-run/status queries from proof of no push run; require exact-SHA job evidence before acceptance.\n- Preserve the prohibition on main merges, production changes and the 5,000-person simulation.\n\n## Validation and limitations\n- Documentation-only changes; no application code, rules, Firebase resources or production settings changed.\n- Changed-path intersections and workflow YAML were inspected. Full-file semantic comparison for all overlapping paths remains the next review gate; no duplicate file was moved or deleted.\n- No exact-head CI pass was established. The inspected workflows do not trigger on pull_request; push-run history still requires a branch-scoped Actions query.\n- PR #41 remains a draft and is not merge-ready. This PR does not close Phase 1.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-19T13:50:03Z","updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:12:18Z","closed_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:20Z","merged_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:20Z","merge_commit_sha":"978d5c3f31bf89e2cfea634c1792403b5738